   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Looking for accommodation",
     "texto": [
      "**Caut un apartament de închiriat** means «I'm looking for an apartment to rent». **Chirie** is «rent»; **chiriaș** is the tenant and **proprietar**, the landlord who owns the accommodation."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Services and the building",
     "texto": [
      "**Bloc** is a block of flats. **Etaj** means «floor» (of a building), and **lift**, «lift». In English, «apartment» is the home and «floor» is the level; in Romanian, **etaj** is only the level inside the building."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
